sheetCart[0] | 6, 6, 32, 32 | The lower part of a cart, frame 0 of 4, used when travelling north. Turned a quarter, half and three quarters clockwise, it serves east, south and west. As a cart crosses a tile it steps through frames 0, 1 and 2, and on a diagonal step frame 3 as well; a cart standing in a room uses frame 0. The cargo is drawn on top of it.
